Ok so following further discussion with @elarlang, I think maybe we need to include this as a business expectation which input validation is checking for so my thought is to try and include it in 5.1.3. I therefore propose the following:

| # | Description | L1 | L2 | L3 | CWE |
| :---: | :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |
| **5.1.3** | [MODIFIED] Verify that all input is validated using positive validation, against an allowed list of values, patterns or ranges to enforce business or functional expectations for that input. | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | 20 |

@ImanSharaf do you think this is sufficient?

@elarlang any further thoughts?

